    <item>
      <title>Free号惊现重置次数</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2498382</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2498382</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 30 Jun 2026 00:49:49 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;一大早上看到站里铺天盖地的说奥特曼又给GPT重置额度了，还额外送了一次重置次数。心想和我关系不大啊，对于白嫖plus几乎没有特殊门路的普通人，我只有一个小规模的free号池，抱着以前有一次奥特曼也给free账户重置额度的想法，尝试在CPA中点了一下刷新凭证，果然free额度没有重置 &lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn.ldstatic.com/images/emoji/twemoji/sweat_smile.png?v=15&quot; title=&quot;:sweat_smile:&quot; class=&quot;emoji&quot; alt=&quot;:sweat_smile:&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot;&gt;。鼠标滑着滑着，突然看到两个曾经美区PP无卡白嫖的两个Plus现在早已降级为free的号后面的重置次数不为0，有点懵，这是bug吗？真的能用吗？下面贴两张图，一张为正常的free是没有重置次数的，一张为从plus降级到free的号有3次重置次数（以前都没怎么关注，今天偶然才看到）&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/2/5/b/25be612885ac747a1faafb238c58bce977cd9086.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/5nTygpBlYDlTeDou3uNuTazuCOi.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/2/5/b/25be612885ac747a1faafb238c58bce977cd9086_2_690x119.png&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;5nTygpBlYDlTeDou3uNuTazuCOi&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;119&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/2/5/b/25be612885ac747a1faafb238c58bce977cd9086_2_690x119.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/2/5/b/25be612885ac747a1faafb238c58bce977cd9086_2_1035x178.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/2/5/b/25be612885ac747a1faafb238c58bce977cd9086_2_1380x238.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;F7F7FA&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
